{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2022-03-15 09:05:00', 'title': 'JENNIE-O SHARES NATIONAL SURVEY RESULTS REVEALING HOW AMERICANS ARE COMBATTING RECIPE BOREDOM & COOKING FATIGUE', 'text': 'SURVEY SHOWS WHERE HOME COOKS FIND INSPIRATION AND SOLUTIONS WILLMAR, MINN., MARCH 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JENNIE-O TURKEY STORE, ONE OF THE MOST BELOVED TURKEY BRANDS IN THE WORLD, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE RESULTS OF ITS LATEST NATIONAL SURVEY SHOWING HOW AMERICANS FEEL ABOUT COOKING AT HOME, RECIPE BOREDOM DURING THE LAST COUPLE YEARS, AND COMPELLING AND UNUSUAL WAYS PEOPLE ARE FINDING INSPIRATION IN THE KITCHEN.'}